{"slug": "practice-dsa-check-if-a-number-is-power-of-2-or-not", "title": "Check if a Number is Power of 2 or Not", "source_url": "https://takeuforward.org/practice/dsa/check-if-a-number-is-power-of-2-or-not", "extracted_by": "live-ssr", "length": 9916, "code_blocks": 0, "images": 0, "html": "<div class=\"flex h-full min-h-0 w-full flex-col\"><div class=\"flex h-full min-h-0 w-full flex-col\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__wrapper\"><div class=\"scroll-fade-module__DRol_a__shell ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__scrollContainer\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__scrollable\" data-tufy-selectable=\"\"><header class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__header\"><h1 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__title\">289. Check if a Number is Power of 2 or Not<span class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__titlePotdBadge\"></span></h1><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__metaRow\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__shortcutButtons\"></div></div></header><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__content\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p>Given an integer n, <strong>return true if it is a power of two</strong>. Otherwise, return false.</p><p>An integer n is a power of two if there exists an integer x such that<strong> n == 2</strong><sup><strong>x</strong></sup><strong>.</strong></p><p><strong>You must solve it without using loops or recursion.</strong></p></div><section class=\"mt-6\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle\">Example 1:</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1rem_1fr] gap-1\"><div aria-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"shrink-0 my-auto mx-auto bg-(--color-brand-primary-bg-3)\" role=\"separator\" style=\"width:1px;height:100%\"></div><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p>Input: n = 1</p><p>Output: true</p><p>Explanation: 2<sup>0</sup> = 1</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mt-6\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle\">Example 2:</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1rem_1fr] gap-1\"><div aria-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"shrink-0 my-auto mx-auto bg-(--color-brand-primary-bg-3)\" role=\"separator\" style=\"width:1px;height:100%\"></div><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p><strong>Input:</strong> n = 16</p><p><strong>Output:</strong> true</p><p><strong>Explanation:</strong> 2<sup>4</sup> = 16</p></div></div></section><section class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationSection mt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-x-2 justify-between w-full\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-x-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle mb-0!\">Now Your Turn!</h3><span class=\"body-b5-regular text-text-secondary\">Pick the correct output for the given input</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationExampleGrid\"><div aria-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"shrink-0 bg-border my-auto ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationExampleDivider\" role=\"separator\" style=\"width:1px;height:100%\"></div><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationExampleContent\"><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText\"><p><strong>Input: </strong>n = -8</p></div></div></div><div aria-required=\"false\" class=\"grid w-full gap-2 ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionsGrid\" data-slot=\"radio-group\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"radiogroup\" style=\"outline:none\" tabindex=\"-1\"><label class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButton ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButtonDisabled cursor-pointer\" for=\"example-3-option-0\"><span class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer\" data-slot=\"tooltip-trigger\" data-state=\"closed\"></span><span class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionText\">true</span></label><label class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButton ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionButtonDisabled cursor-pointer\" for=\"example-3-option-1\"><span class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer\" data-slot=\"tooltip-trigger\" data-state=\"closed\"></span><span class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__gamificationOptionText\">false</span></label></div></section><div aria-label=\"Still unsure what the problem is asking ?\" class=\"ExplainProblemCta-module__pPRrwq__card\"><div class=\"ExplainProblemCta-module__pPRrwq__copy\"><p class=\"body-b6-semibold text-text-primary\">Still unsure what the problem is asking ?</p> <p class=\"body-b6-regular text-text-tertiary\">Let’s go through a few more examples, step by step, to make it clearer.</p></div></div><section class=\"mt-6\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle\">Constraints:</h3><div class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__richText ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__constraintsBox\"><p>-2<sup>31</sup> &lt;= n &lt;= 2<sup>31 </sup>- 1</p></div></section></div><div class=\"mt-6\"><h3 class=\"ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__sectionTitle\">Hints</h3><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__accordion\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-slot=\"accordion\"><div class=\"not-last:border-b ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__accordionItem\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-slot=\"accordion-item\" data-state=\"closed\"><h3 class=\"flex\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"></h3><div aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_36j4lknqlpfijb_\" class=\"overflow-hidden text-sm data-open:animate-accordion-down data-closed:animate-accordion-up\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-slot=\"accordion-content\" data-state=\"closed\" hidden=\"\" id=\"radix-_R_b6j4lknqlpfijb_\" role=\"region\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col ProblemPanel-module__qBixIa__accordion\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-slot=\"accordion\"><div class=\"not-last:border-b ProblemPan